	(text "Display: MSP2807-type 2.8in 240x320 SPI module, 14-pin header.\nSDO (pin 9) and touch pins 10-14 are left open: the display SDO is not\nguaranteed to tri-state and would share SPI_MISO with the MAX31856.\nNo pull-ups on BTN_x: the ESP32 internal pull-ups are used, and BTN_Y is\nGPIO12 (strapping pin) which must not be pulled high at boot."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 172.72 0)
		(effects
